# Applied in order, with `patch -p1`, to an unpacked upstream Wine tree.
#
# Everything here is currently a *carried third-party fix*, not our own work.
# All four come from Debian's wine packaging and keep their original DEP-3
# headers naming their authors and upstream bugs. We carry them because
# upstream Wine 10.0 does not build usably on Debian trixie without the first
# one, and the rest are fixes we would otherwise hit.
#
# When we add Stained Glass patches of our own, they go in patches/sg/ so the
# distinction between "carried from elsewhere" and "ours to upstream" stays
# obvious at a glance.

fixes/binutils2.44.patch
fixes/virtual-protect.patch
fixes/ntdll-398da925.patch
fixes/fstype.patch
